# 30 — QA & Release

Always applicable.

- No "complete/final/ready/released" claim without required validation (see `docs/planning/QA_GATES.md`).
- Automated QA preferred; record results in `qa/reports/`.
- Reviewer agents must not silently edit the artifact being certified; switch to fix mode explicitly.
- No commit or push unless explicitly requested.
